{"severity":"error","file":"errors/cap_grant_27.march","start_line":17,"start_col":2,"end_line":23,"end_col":5,"message":"`main` performs IO but declares no grant. The program reaches `IO.Console`; a `main` with no capability parameter is granted nothing.\nhelp: declare the grant `main` actually needs —\n        fn main(_cap_console : Cap(IO.Console)) : ()\nor grant everything with `fn main(cap : Cap(IO))`.\n`forge fix` can apply this.","code":"cap_grant","fix":{"kind":"replace","start_line":17,"start_col":9,"end_line":17,"end_col":11,"text":"(_cap_console : Cap(IO.Console))","applicability":"machine-applicable"},"labels":[],"notes":[],"category":"CAPABILITY"}
